+同一批路由。视觉 projector 支持 checkpoint 的 `rot_proj`，位置插值按
+参考推理实现使用 bicubic。专家 eFSDP 的列/行切分规则见
+[专家并行](../features/expert_parallel.md)。
+
 ## 新模型适配
 
 新模型的接入方式参见[模型适配指南](../develop/model_adaptation.md)。
+
+### Kimi-K3 packed multimodal training
+
+With `use_remove_padding=True`, verl passes raw-token `cu_seqlens` to the Kimi-K3 forward. Image expansion updates these boundaries before passing them to KDA, causal conv1d, and MLA. Position IDs restart for each sample. The NPU causal FlashAttention backend uses TND with explicit sequence ends; the CPU fallback masks cross-sample attention. Packed training requires no KV cache and does not support routing replay. These boundaries must not be replaced with an all-ones decoder mask.
